OL,5,G1855 Four in a Bed
OL,6,     FThe group check in to the boutique
OL,7,     FUrban Beach B&B in Bournemouth,
OL,8,     Fwith its mod cons and deluxe
OL,9,     Fbathrooms. And host Mark treats
OL,10,     Fhis guests to a speedboat ride
OL,11,     Falong the Jurassic Coast.
OL,12,G1925 Four in a Bed
OL,13,     FThe B&Bers meet for one last time
OL,14,     Fto find out how much they've been
OL,15,     Fpaid and to thrash out their
OL,16,     Fdifferences. There's trouble as
OL,17,     FMrs Tee and Alistair and Emma
OL,18,     Fclash over their scores.
